{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31370","headline":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作二首 一 · 于瓌","name":"和绵州于中丞登越王楼作二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼因藩邸号，川势似依楼。\n显敞含清暑，岚光入素秋。\n山宜姑射貌，江泛李膺舟。\n郢曲思朋执，轻纱画胜游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于瓌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}